<div>
    <h3>关于征集2023年秋季学期校企合作创新创业课程的通知</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2023-02-22 11:20:49<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 16220)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:黑体; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:等线;} @font-face {font-family:方正小标宋简体;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@黑体"; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@方正小标宋简体";} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋_GB2312";} @font-face {font-family:"\@等线";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:等线;} p.MsoHeader, li.MsoHeader, div.MsoHeader {mso-style-link:"页眉 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; vsb_temp-mode:char; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:等线;} p.MsoFooter, li.MsoFooter, div.MsoFooter {mso-style-link:"页脚 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; vsb_temp-mode:char; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:等线;} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:#0563C1; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:#954F72; text-decoration:underline;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;} p.MsoAcetate, li.MsoAcetate, div.MsoAcetate {mso-style-link:"批注框文本 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:等线;} span.1 {mso-style-name:未处理的提及1; color:#605E5C; background:#E1DFDD;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"批注框文本 Char"; mso-style-link:批注框文本;} span.Char0 {mso-style-name:"页眉 Char"; mso-style-link:页眉;} span.Char1 {mso-style-name:"页脚 Char"; mso-style-link:页脚;}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">为进一步深化创新创业教育改革，深入推进创新创业教育与专业教育深度融合，引导建设校企共建专创融合课程，健全学校创新创业教育课程体系，促进学生全面个性发展，根据《西安电子科技大学创新创业实验班办理办法》（创院字</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">〔2022〕3号</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">），现面向全校开展2023年秋季学期创新创业实验班课程征集活动。相关工作事宜通知如下：</span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 黑体; font-size: 14pt;">一、征集范围</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">本次面向全校征集课程，可以是新设课程，也可以对现有课程进行改造使之符合实验班课程要求。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 黑体; font-size: 14pt;">二、课程要求</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">课程需突出创新创业人才培养特色和实践环节，具体要求如下：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">1.课程不少于1学分（16学时）；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">2.企业专家授课时间不少于30%；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">3.课程人数不低于30人，不超过60人；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">4.课程内容应紧密结合学科特色，同时与行业发展密切融合，注重体现行业前沿、企业发展等内容；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">5.优先支持与企业类国家双创示范基地合作的课程；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">6.鼓励课程安排实地走访、校外实践等环节，拓展学生视野;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">7.课程能持续开设，为学生提供长期服务；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">8.符合学校对课程设计的其他要求。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29pt; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 黑体; font-size: 14.5pt; font-weight: normal;">三、征集流程</span></strong></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29pt; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">1.课程负责人申请材料。负责人填写《</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">创新创业实验班校企合作课程申请审批表</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">》（附件1）、《</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">创新创业实验班校企合作课程<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.1pt;">申请汇总表</span></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">》（附件2）并由所属学院审核并出具意见。</span></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 28pt; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">2.材料提交。课程负责人应于</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">于3月17日前将申请材料（附件1、附件2）电子版及盖章复印件发送至创新创业学院邮箱</span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">cxcy@xidian.edu.cn，邮件主题命名为</span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;">“</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">创新创业实验班+学院</span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;">”</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">。</span></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29pt; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">3.创新创业学院组织评审。学院</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">组织专家对课程申请材料进行评审，拟定立项课程名单并予以公示。</span></span><a name="_GoBack"></a></p>
 <p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29pt; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">4.公示期结束后。各课程将纳入创新创业课程库，优先推荐入库课程参与省级以上课程评选活动。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29pt; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14.5pt;">5.学员选拔。秋季学期选课前，创新创业学院将汇总入库课程清单，面向全校学生开展宣传，学生在选课系统内自行选择。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 黑体; font-size: 14pt;">四、联系方式</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">联系人：创新创业学院李彦吉</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">办公地点：国家双创示范基地（大活）II区103</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">电&nbsp; 话：029-81891310</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">邮&nbsp; 箱：cxcy@xidian.edu.cn</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;">附件1：《创新创业实验班校企合作课程申请申报书》</span></p>
